---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /services/
title: "Services"
seoTitle: "Temporary Works Design Services | Checking, RAMS, BS 5975 | UK"
metaDescription: "Temporary Works Design, design checking, BS 5975:2024 support, RAMS & ITPs, hoardings, propping, excavations, working platforms, scaffold support, virtual audits and weekly support."
breadcrumbs:
  - name: "Home"
    url: "/"
  - name: "Services"
    url: "/services/"
---
<div class="page-head">
  <div class="container">
    <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb" style="padding-top:0">
      <a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span>Services
    </nav>
    <p class="eyebrow">Services</p>
    <h1>Temporary Works Design &amp; advisory services</h1>
    <p>Practical support across the full temporary works lifecycle — design, checking, documentation, audits, training and retained weekly support. UK and international, remote and project-based.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="grid grid-2">
      {%- for s in services %}
      <div class="card">
        <span class="icon-badge"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="{{ s.icon }}"/></svg></span>
        <h3>{{ s.title }}</h3>
        <p>{{ s.summary }}</p>
        <p class="card-meta"><b>Typical deliverables:</b> {{ s.deliverables | join(", ") }}.</p>
        <p class="card-meta"><b>Suitable for:</b> {{ s.clients | join(", ") }}.</p>
        <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top:0.5rem">
          <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/services/{{ s.slug }}/">Learn more</a>
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact/">Request a Quote</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      {%- endfor %}

      <!-- Weekly support card -->
      <div class="card" style="border-color:var(--amber)">
        <span class="icon-badge"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 8v4l3 3M21 12a9 9 0 1 1-18 0 9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"/></svg></span>
        <h3>Weekly Temporary Works Support</h3>
        <p>Retained, predictable support for contractors who need ongoing temporary works input.</p>
        <p class="card-meta"><b>Typical deliverables:</b> register, brief, RAMS/ITP review, virtual audits, mentoring, early risk input.</p>
        <p class="card-meta"><b>Suitable for:</b> contractors needing fast, recurring advisory support.</p>
        <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top:0.5rem">
          <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/weekly-support/">Learn more</a>
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact/?type=weekly">Ask for Weekly Support</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--tint">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="cta-band">
      <h2>Not sure which service you need?</h2>
      <p>Send your Temporary Works Register, design brief or site query and the right support will be confirmed with a clear scope and fee.</p>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact/">Request a Quote</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="tel:{{ site.phoneHref }}">Book a Call</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
